# title: Digital call (cash-or-nothing)
# category: Vanillas and digitals
# underlyings: 1
# source: Reiner & Rubinstein, Unscrambling the Binary Code, Risk, 1991
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Pays a fixed 100 if the stock ends above its strike-date level, nothing otherwise.
#
# A hard threshold makes the Monte-Carlo delta noisy: tick "Fuzzy" to
# smooth the comparison.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    if spot() > s0 then pays 100 endIf
